# Game data is copyrighted and never committed
# GAME: its file names or folders

# Build outputs
/build/
/dist/

# pictures the game writes when it is run from here (they show the game's artwork)
*.ppm
*.png
# ... but the screenshots of the README are kept (tools/screenshots.sh makes them)
!/docs/screenshots/*.png
# ... and the README's banner and screenshots (hybrid/docs/readme.md)
!/docs/*.png
# ... and each game's logo, shown at its start (host version 17; Danik's)
!/package/logos/*.png
# ... and the gameplay screenshots for dnkLauncher (hybrid/docs/dnklauncher.md)
!/package/screens/*.png
# ... and each game's logo and icon for tty2oled+'s OLED display (hybrid/docs/oled.md)
!/package/oled/*.png
